      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ¿tú qué me ves?\nAquí nadie te invitó.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00790065002C002000BF007400FA00200071007500E90020006D00650020007600650073003F000A00410071007500ED0020006E006100640069006500200074006500200069006E00760069007400F3002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás mirando mi Holotransportador? Deja\nde mirar tanto si sabes lo que te conviene.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué estás mirando?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000650073007400E100730020006D006900720061006E0064006F003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Acaso quieres usar mi Holotransportador?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0041006300610073006F00200071007500690065007200650073002000750073006100720020006D006900200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te vas a tener que quedar con las ganas,\nporque es mío y solo yo lo puedo usar.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSe mira, pero no se toca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si insistes en usarlo, tendrá que ser\npor las malas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006900200069006E00730069007300740065007300200065006E00200075007300610072006C006F002C002000740065006E0064007200E100200071007500650020007300650072000A0070006F00720020006C006100730020006D0061006C006100730021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si quieres que te dé una paliza en un combate,\n¡ya sabes dónde encontrarme! ¡Pero yo que tú lo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npensaría bien!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si tanto quieres usar mi Holotransportador,\nvas a tener que sufrir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530069002000740061006E0074006F00200071007500690065007200650073002000750073006100720020006D006900200048006F006C006F007400720061006E00730070006F0072007400610064006F0072002C000A00760061007300200061002000740065006E00650072002000710075006500200073007500660072006900720021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a combatir!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F00730020006100200063006F006D0062006100740069007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mira, me da igual",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900720061002C0020006D006500200064006100200069006700750061006C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sabia decisión! Ahora lárgate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530061006200690061002000640065006300690073006900F3006E0021002000410068006F007200610020006C00E100720067006100740065002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pfff, parece que tienes ganas de que te dé\nuna paliza. No digas que no te lo advertí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ayyy, lo siento mucho! ¡Perdóname!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007900790079002C0020006C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0020006D007500630068006F0021002000A1005000650072006400F3006E0061006D00650021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No tenía ni la menor idea de que eras tan fuerte!\n¡Te pido disculpas por faltarte al respeto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, no dudes en usar el Holotransportador\nsi lo necesitas. Lo mío es tuyo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÚsalo todas las veces que quieras.\nNada me haría más feliz.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tranquil<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, yo me quedo aquí vigilando para\nque tengas el Holotransportador a tu disposición<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncuando quieras.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este Holotransportador es de uso público,\npor supuesto. Úsalo todo lo que quieras.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
